  "description": "WAWTEX crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C83 H76 N41 Nd6 O31,8(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd5 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd6 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.131-4.235 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.07-121.74°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C83H81N41Nd6O39. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
